      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OKLAHOMA BALE (2) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at Warrnambool over 450m behind Mr. Jones (25.81) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Has claims if he runs up to expectations. PAW REVY (8) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 5th at Warragul in Grade 5 H company. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Key runner on best form. TRICKY DISCO (1) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a Grade 4/5 three back before a placing at this track the following run. Can feature with the right run. MARCO MARCO (7) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
